    "title_en",
    "desc_ar",
    "desc_en"
   ],
   "note": "provider+external_id is the idempotency key every feed sync relies on. external_id is NULLABLE on purpose: own/uploaded rows have no external id, and a unique index never collides on NULL. A NOT NULL DEFAULT '' here would allow exactly ONE own game per install (bug caught by tools/prove_runtime.py proof C)"
  },
