   "note": "the product's core table: no game is visible unless a row here says why. audit_verdict is a CACHE of the last Licensing\\LicenseAuditor run so an admin list can filter blocked games with one indexed query; the auditor recomputes it from db/license_rules.json every time and never trusts the cached value."
  },
  "license_audits": {
   "columns": {
    "id": {
